{"author":{"id":"2eecc7d99b502c158aacb0868dca9358610edc02724d21fe49b0196402d3364e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1795771137,"nonce":"8DpN40JkVPPNX3QE5o1c4Wlc1c8=","title":"Argo CD plugin: real Argo captures, the manual-sync revision case, and per-wait read cost","message":"What still applies from 9b2e8d1 (closed with items open), checked against main @2b747905 on 2026-11-27. The reporter loop those items were written for was removed by ADR-0074; what remains is the wait-live gate (crates/scarab-plugin-argocd/src/gates.rs).\n\nStill open:\n1. Real Argo captures (9b2e8d1 item #12). Every fixture in tests/fixtures/argocd/ is synthetic, and the plugin has never been run against a real Argo CD. Capture GET /api/v1/applications/\u003cname\u003e and .../managed-resources (redacted) from a real instance, covering Synced+Healthy, Progressing, Degraded or failed sync, multi-source and an app outside the default namespace; add them as fixtures, and run wait-live once live. In progress with the dg2 session against Treebo staging Argo CD (owner 2026-11-27).\n2. The manual-sync revision case (L2). assess prefers syncResult.revision (assess.rs operation_is_current). A failed operation with no syncResult and a symbolic operation.sync.revision (HEAD, a branch, a Helm chart version) cannot be told from a current one, so it stays in_progress (never wrongly failed) and the wait runs to its expiry. Decide with real captures of a failed manual sync.\n3. Per-wait read cost (L4, in a new form). Every gate pass (15 s, config.rs gate_interval) reads the Application and its managed-resources for every open wait, up to 4 at once (GATE_READS_AT_ONCE), and the broker journals each read. Nothing skips an unchanged Application. If many long waits make this costly, read managed-resources only when metadata.generation, the sync revision(s) or the health status changed since the last pass.\n\nDone since 9b2e8d1 (no action):\n- L3 OnDelete StatefulSets/DaemonSets: documented in usage/deploying-with-argo-cd.mdx (What this doesn't cover).\n- L5 Retrying-attempt note: stripped (assess.rs without_retry_note).\n- A failing Application blocking the loop: reads run concurrently with a bound (tests/gate_pass.rs a_hung_application_does_not_hold_up_the_other_gates, a_pass_reads_at_most_its_bound_of_applications_at_once).\n- Tests for 409/429/503 (an_error_status_on_a_read_leaves_the_wait_open_for_the_next_pass, a_409_on_the_answer_is_reported_and_the_pass_goes_on), token rotation (the_plugin_sends_its_own_rotating_token_and_never_the_argo_token), multi-source fixtures, apps outside the default namespace (an_application_outside_argos_namespace_is_read_with_app_namespace), DELETED (the plugin polls; an_application_deleted_between_passes_leaves_the_wait_open).","files":null}]}